For a port, read the `porting`, `upstream-maintenance`, `module-architecture`, and `testing` skills plus `.agents/rules/third-party-materials.md` and `.agents/rules/port-destination.md`. Build a source PR family manifest and adapt integration edits to current Goob Reforged code.

Destination: use the root `Content.Arcane.*` projects and existing `_Arcane` resource paths by default. Apply the provenance-based exceptions in `.agents/rules/port-destination.md` for confirmed TraumaStation additions and Trauma-side revert restorations. Source markers do not travel; mark only inherited/base integration edits as required by the canonical marker rules.

Add English localization when required. Add or edit Russian localization only when the user explicitly requests it. Preserve asset licensing and attribution.
